 # Ascension 1.5.0 plugin report
 
+> **Source patches applied:** the shop product table and prices below are catalog v2 as released in 1.5.0. This source tree
+> ships catalog v3 (see [MARKET_BALANCE.md](MARKET_BALANCE.md)); the exchange is one-way and Tideborn's land ability changed.
